<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Info Ticket</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/header-tech') %>
    <main class="container-fluid px-md-5 py-4 bg-light min-vh-100">

    <div class="mb-4">
        <a href="/technicien/Tableaubord" class="text-decoration-none fw-semibold text-primary">&larr; Retour au Tableau de bord</a>
    </div>

    <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row justify-content-between align-items-sm-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <h2 class="fw-bold text-dark m-0">Accès VPN bloqué</h2>
        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <span class="badge bg-primary px-4 py-2 fs-6 rounded-3">En cours</span>
            <span class="badge bg-danger px-4 py-2 fs-6 rounded-3">Haute</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
        
        <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 rounded-4 bg-white h-100">
                <h4 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark mb-4">Informations de la demande</h4>
                
                <div class="mb-4 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <div>
                        <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Auteur :</span> 
                        <span class="text-secondary ms-1">Marie Leroy</span>
                    </div>
                    <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm border px-3 py-1-5 rounded-3 fw-semibold text-secondary">Contacter</button>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Date de création :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">28/04/2026 à 08h15</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Identifiant :</span> 
                    <span class="text-secondary ms-1">1023</span>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-5">
                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark">Catégorie :</span> 
                    <span class="badge bg-light text-dark border ms-1 px-3 py-1-5 fw-medium">Réseau / Sécurité</span>
                </div>

                <div class="border-top pt-4">
                    <h5 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark mb-3">Description du problème :</h5>
                    <p class="text-secondary lh-lg fs-6 bg-light p-3 rounded-3">
                        Bonjour, je n'arrive plus à me connecter au VPN depuis ce matin, j'ai un message d'erreur 'Auth Failed' quand je rentre mes identifiants. Merci de m'aider rapidement, je suis en télétravail.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm p-4 rounded-4 bg-white h-100 d-flex flex-column justify-content-between">
                <div>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold text-center text-dark mb-4">Traitement de l'incident</h4>
                    
                    <form>
                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Changer le Statut :</label>
                            <select class="form-select custom-select py-2-5 px-3 rounded-3">
                                <option value="ouvert">Ouvert</option>
                                <option value="en_cours" selected>En cours</option>
                                <option value="resolu">Résolu</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Changer la Priorité :</label>
                            <select class="form-select custom-select py-2-5 px-3 rounded-3">
                                <option value="basse">Basse</option>
                                <option value="moyenne">Moyenne</option>
                                <option value="haute" selected>Haute</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Note d'intervention technique :</label>
                            <textarea class="form-control border rounded-3 p-3" rows="4" placeholder="Renseignez ici les détails de votre intervention..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center border-top pt-4 mt-3">
                    <a href="/technicien/Tableaubord" class="text-decoration-none text-secondary fw-semibold fs-5">Annuler</a>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary px-5 py-2-5 rounded-3 fw-bold shadow-sm">Enregistrer</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

</main>
    
</body>
</html>